  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RMGP-TWB DIHR: Promoting and Protecting the Human Rights of Migrants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective for  the project is that migration management is  more human rights-based in both focus and transit countries and along migration routes in T&#xfc;rkiye and the Western Balkans region.

The expected outcomes of the project, which follow the expected outcomes of the overarching RMGP Turkiye and Western Balkans programme, are as follows:

1. Enhanced migration management, including strengthened integrated border management (IBM), Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration (AVRR) as well as documentation

2.  Enhanced asylum systems and processing

3. Enhanced access to labour markets for refugees and migrants

4. Countering migrant smuggling and trafficking</narrative>
  </description>
